WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:43.040
<i>Led by the eight crests,
the children's new adventure began.</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:50.290
<i>What awaits the children who search for
a power to counter the Great Catastrophe?</i>

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.470
<i>As Mimi and Palmon follow
the Digivice's direction,</i>

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.090
<i>they reached the edge of Cloud Continent.</i>

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.220
<i>This location was
near the Tanemon's village</i>

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>where Mimi used to reign as the queen.</i>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.310
<i>However...</i>

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.910
It's been so long!

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.870
I hope everyone's doing okay!

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:22.240
Yeah. We should have brought
Golemon and the others too!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.660
What's that?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.840
THE DIGIMON SCHOOL UNDER ATTACK

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.590
When did this get here?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.550
Can I help you with something?

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:49.820
U-Um, do you know of my servants,
the Tanemon?

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:52.570
They used to live here not long ago?

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:55.440
Hm? The Tanemon, you say?

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.990
Oh! Those Tanemon
are all studying here now.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.990
Studying?!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.580
Indeed.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.040
This place is an honorable Digimon school!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:14.010
One, two! One, two...

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.520
Look, the Tanemon!

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.260
Oh, it's Mimi!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:28.520
I am the principal
of this Digimon school...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.270
I am Babamon.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.270
BABAMON

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.270
Babamon?

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:43.030
Our school strives for the evolution
of a strong, pure, and beautiful Digimon!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.370
We offer an education
with that as our school motto.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.670
Evolution!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.830
Then, does that mean...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.590
I'm Mimi's servant No. 6!

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.130
I'm No. 12!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.680
We all became Lalamon!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.670
LALAMON

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.850
Wow! Lalamon?

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.350
All of you evolved from Tanemon!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.930
Uh-huh!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.280
So what do you think?

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:13.230
Currently, we are offering a free,
three-day trial course.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.650
Maybe I could evolve more too!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.230
Yeah, yeah!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.740
Then sign right here.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.500
Okay, is this good?

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.780
Me too!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.330
Then let's first have a tour
of the school and--

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.750
Silence!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.620
Now that you've enrolled...

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.630
you'll be listening to my instructions!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.380
Palmon and umm, you were?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.350
I signed my name!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.810
My name is Mimi Tachikawa!

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.810
The one who first establi--

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:56.440
Tachika... wa... Mimi... Tachi...

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:03.150
You will call yourself
"Mimimon" starting today!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.530
Mimimon?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.450
But I'm human...

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.000
Quit complaining and run 100 laps
around the track!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.910
W-What?!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.260
Are you okay?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.640
I can't do this...

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.220
Me neither...

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:32.180
This harsh training has continued
every day since I enrolled.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.950
Today was 256 laps too.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:35.940
What?!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.230
That much?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:41.110
Mimimon! Palmon! What are you doing?!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.530
One, two! One, two!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.870
Hey, isn't this a little too much?!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.110
That's right!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.410
Oh, defiant, are we?

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:52.120
Those kind of students need a lesson!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.500
Hey, what are you doing to Mimi?!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:01.130
You both need to learn a lesson!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.960
That's my line!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.720
Palmon Evolution!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.130
Togemon!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.550
Oh? Let's see what you can do!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.140
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.270
Oh, this is nice!

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.390
Here!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.150
What?!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:25.030
Ah, these needles feel great
for my back pain!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.320
Then we'll...

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.120
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.050
Lilimon!

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:43.630
Oh? What will you do for me now?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.260
Flower Cannon!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.100
Of course moxa works best for back pain!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.140
There!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.480
Go on! Run along!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.690
I can fly, you know!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.910
Go on! Go, go! Keep going!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.380
Those were some
rather impressive evolutions.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.260
But they're still premature!

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:30.720
If you want to become strong, pure,
and beautiful like me,

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.300
you must put in the effort!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.400
Now, our next class is target practice
for when a bad Digimon attacks.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.360
We gotta show off this time!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.650
Yeah.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.280
Five points. Next!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.540
Ten points.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.170
Keep going! Next!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:03.170
Yes, yes, yes!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.880
Palmon, go!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.790
Poison Ivy!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.050
Oh! 50 points.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.880
Yes! Yes!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.730
Okay, Mimimon next.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.060
Begin attacking!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.430
What?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.890
Uh, attack?

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:26.400
Don't you have laser beam eyes
or shoot missiles from your mouth?!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.270
I'm human...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.940
Then here.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.450
Oops.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.370
Mimimon, zero points!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.720
Next, the obstacle course!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.720
Huh? Where are the obstacles?

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.800
Here!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.970
You must avoid the brooms
and reach the goal.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.980
On your marks!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.940
Get set...

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.070
Even I can do this much!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.980
Hup!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.490
Be careful! Those brooms are...

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.740
Huh? They move?!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.580
I can't jump that high!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.620
And Mimimon, zero points!

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:35.510
As a Digimon, having beautiful reflexes
is also important!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.390
Babamon Dance!
Make sure to master it well!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.270
Mimimon, negative 100 points!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.810
Mimi...

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.170
Ugh, my entire body aches!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:07.460
Hang on, Mimi.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.710
Jeez, I'm leaving this dumb school!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.470
You are, um...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.930
Jijimon.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.840
JIJIMON

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.140
About the principal,
no, Babamon...

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.810
Do forgive Babamon's actions please.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.230
Not too long ago...

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.990
There was a very talented student
who succeeded in a Mega Evolution,

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.320
but that Digimon turned into a delinquent.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:47.880
Babamon attempted to teach the student
the correct way to use those powers,

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.750
<i>but it ended in an argument.</i>

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.800
<i>In the end, that student
decided to leave the school.</i>

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:00.220
Blaming Babamon's own incompetence,

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:05.770
the lessons are now
taught strictly and thoroughly,

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:10.600
so that all students would cultivate
a good heart that won't ever be swayed.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:16.280
This is all for the good of the students.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.240
Say, Palmon.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:24.500
It's only for three days anyway.
Should we do it a little longer?

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:25.530
Okay!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.040
Thank you.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.420
I really can't do this anymore!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.540
It's impossible to avoid these!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.880
How pitiful, Mimimon!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.550
And also...

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.600
Jeez, this is tough!

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.050
Yeah...

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.730
Why are you two here too?!

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:50.190
Well, we happened to drop by and...

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:53.310
It looked fun, so we got enrolled!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:59.410
Come on! Quit slacking, new students!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.150
Yes!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:19.920
Ten points!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.220
I hit it...

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.930
You did it, Mimi-chan!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:24.930
Wow!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:29.810
Looks like I moved up a little
from zero points.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.060
You've still got a long way to go!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.770
What?!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.610
Then 20 points next! I'll get it for sure!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.940
That's the spirit.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.610
What is it?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.580
Long time no see...

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.880
Principal Babamon!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.420
Banchomamemon...

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.030
Jijimon, are you okay?

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.900
Mm. More importantly...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:25.400
That's the student
who became a delinquent and disappeared.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.410
What does someone
who left on their own want now?

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.790
BANCHOMAMEMON

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.830
I came to say thanks...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:39.170
to your rotten soul that wouldn't accept
me for evolving into a Mega Digimon!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.470
Oh! So Banchomamemon
just came to say thanks!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:46.260
Actually, "say thanks"
means to get revenge.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.180
What?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.810
You still don't understand the reason
why I never acknowledged you?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:55.560
The reason?
Hmph! You're just rotten, that's all!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.020
Zero points.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:01.020
If you can't find the answer yourself,
I can't give you your diploma.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:05.900
I don't need such a thing!
I'll graduate on my own!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.290
I have nothing left to learn from you!

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:10.910
I'll prove it to you!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.620
Hey, y'all!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.210
Come and play
with the little underclassmen!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.000
Hey! Not the students!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.480
Help!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.470
MAMEMON GANG

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.560
Agumon!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.900
Agumon Evolution!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.540
Greymon!

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:53.870
Palmon!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.210
Palmon Evolution!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.540
Togemon!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.630
Everyone, get behind Greymon!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.510
Hup! I shall help as well.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.760
Thanks!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.360
Empress Haze!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.000
You have a long way to go.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.800
When did you...

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.060
There's no escape!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.890
Ain't this a full score?!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.810
What?!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.520
Huh? Who are you?!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:12.410
A current trial student... Mimimon!

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:13.530
Mimimon!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.410
Principal Babamon,
you should just be honest and say it.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:20.420
"Bancho, you've dropped out!"

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:21.670
A dropout!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:22.710
A failure!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.300
Negative trillion points!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:29.170
Y-You little brat!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.170
Mimimon!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.980
<i>The broom! The obstacle course!</i>

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:38.930
Hup!

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.230
Tsk! One more!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.480
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.650
Togemon!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.980
I'll finish you both...

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.240
The needles earlier?!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.530
Togemon!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.320
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.330
Lilimon!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.580
Flower Cannon!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.510
Get ready!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.380
Babamon Dance!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.130
What?!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:23.390
Now do you understand how strong I am?!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.070
Yes, it's true that you're strong.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:32.280
But you aren't pure or beautiful at all!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.990
What?!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.700
Lilimon!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.250
It's time to show
the results of our training!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.870
Okay, Mimi!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:41.870
Strongly!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.880
Purely!

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.790
Beautifully!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.500
Lilimon Mega Evolution!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.430
Rosemon!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.890
ROSEMON

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:00.390
Wha...

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.930
Ohh!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.140
Wow!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.650
My goodness...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.030
Mimi.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:11.150
Rosemon!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.320
You became a Mega Digimon, so what?!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.580
Rose Whip!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.720
How's that?!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.480
What?!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.980
Roses Rapier!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.500
Why?!

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.740
Why did I...

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.500
You answered that yourself earlier!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.300
That's right.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.630
"You became a Mega Digimon, so what?!"

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.930
You're starting to understand on your own

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:22.140
what Principal Babamon
wanted you to notice.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.390
Forbidden Temptation!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.400
I've... lost.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.740
